  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Pre-appraisal of the Burkina Faso Bilateral Programme: 2021 &#x2013; 2025</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of this pre-appraisal is to assess early the quality and feasibility of the proposed bilateral projects against the overall strategic framework 2021-2025. Based on this the pre-appraisal team will recommend on necessary adjustments for follow-ups to be taken prior to the final desk appraisal and submission to MFA senior management for approval.</narrative>
